    "description": "<p>The Gungans are omnivorous humanoids native to the swamps of <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Naboo\" title=\"Naboo\">Naboo</a>. Technologically advanced, they rely mostly on biotech, growing instead of building their homes and production facilities. </p><p>While their culture is peaceful, it evolved from a series of long, bloody clan wars, and Gungans still admire strength and cunning. Most communities are devoted to farming or manufacturing goods that are then traded to other Gungan settlements, but they will reluctantly trade with the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Humans\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Humans\">Humans</a> of <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Naboo\" title=\"Naboo\">Naboo</a>. </p><h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gungan_Characteristics\">Gungan Characteristics</span></h3><p><b>Personality:</b> Gungans tend to be inquisitive, cautious, and suspicious. </p><p><b>Physical Description:</b> Gungans range from 1.6 to 2 meters tall, with two eyestalks, floppy ears, and long tongues. </p><p><b><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Age_Groups\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Age Groups\">Age Groups</a>:</b> Gungans age at the following stages: </p><table class=\"wikitable\"> \n <tbody>\n  <tr> \n   <th>CHILD </th> \n   <th>YOUNG ADULT </th> \n   <th>ADULT </th> \n   <th>MIDDLE AGE </th> \n   <th>OLD </th> \n   <th>VENERABLE </th>\n  </tr> \n  <tr> \n   <td>1-12 Years </td> \n   <td>13-15 Years </td> \n   <td>16-35 Years </td> \n   <td>36-54 Years </td> \n   <td>55-64 Years </td> \n   <td>65+ Years </td>\n  </tr>\n </tbody>\n</table><p><b>Homeworld:</b> The serene world of <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Naboo\" title=\"Naboo\">Naboo</a>. </p><p><b>Languages:</b> Gungans speak, read, and write both Gunganese and Basic. </p><p><b>Example Names:</b> Fassa, Jar Jar, Rugor, Tarpals, Toba, Tobler Ceel, Yoss. </p><p><b>Adventurers:</b> Many Gungans leave their underwater cities to explore as <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Scouts\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Scouts\">Scouts</a>. Since the treaty with the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Humans\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Humans\">Humans</a> of <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Naboo\" title=\"Naboo\">Naboo</a>, some Gungans- perhaps driven by an impulse to regain the warrior spirit of old as <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Soldiers\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Soldiers\">Soldiers</a>- have taken a larger step into galactic society. </p><h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gungan_Species_Traits\">Gungan Species Traits</span></h3><p>Gungans share the following Species Traits: </p><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Additional_Gungan_Species_Feats\">Additional Gungan Species Feats</span></h2><p><i>Reference Book:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Star_Wars_Saga_Edition_Rebellion_Era_Campaign_Guide\" title=\"Star Wars Saga Edition Rebellion Era Campaign Guide\">Star Wars Saga Edition Rebellion Era Campaign Guide</a></i> </p><p>Gungan characters have access to the following <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Species_Feats\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Species Feats\">Species Feats</a>. No Species Feats are considered Bonus Feats for any <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Heroic_Class\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Heroic Class\">Heroic Class</a>. </p><table class=\"wikitable\"> \n <tbody>\n  <tr> \n   <th>SPECIES FEAT </th> \n   <th> </th> \n   <th>BENEFITS </th>\n  </tr> \n  <tr> \n   <td><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Gungan_Weapon_Master\" title=\"Gungan Weapon Master\">Gungan Weapon Master</a> </td> \n   <td> </td> \n   <td>Increase the die type when adding <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Force_Points\" title=\"Force Points\">Force Points</a> to attacks with an <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Atlatl\" title=\"Atlatl\">Atlatl</a> or <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Cesta\" title=\"Cesta\">Cesta</a>. </td>\n  </tr> \n  <tr> \n   <td><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Perfect_Swimmer\" title=\"Perfect Swimmer\">Perfect Swimmer</a> </td> \n   <td> </td> \n   <td>Reroll <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Swim\" title=\"Swim\">Swim</a> checks, always keeping the better result. </td>\n  </tr> \n  <tr> \n   <td><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Warrior_Heritage\" title=\"Warrior Heritage\">Warrior Heritage</a> </td> \n   <td> </td> \n   <td>Gain a bonus to <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Will_Defense\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Will Defense\">Will Defense</a> when using an <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Atlatl\" title=\"Atlatl\">Atlatl</a> or <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Cesta\" title=\"Cesta\">Cesta</a>. </td>\n  </tr>\n </tbody>\n</table>",
